{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">網上近日瘋傳一段影片，有荃灣街童騎着俗稱「子彈仔」的單車四處挑釁路人。據悉，事發地點位於荃灣西一帶，影片開首可見一名騎着「子彈仔」單車的青年，突然拿着物件擲向在單車徑上步行的男子，期間疑似拍片者即時發出笑聲。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h33m55s517.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026wWt9s5K7S51784692658.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h33m55s517.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h33m59s992.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026WESk4n6exH1784692659.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h33m59s992.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">街童轉至荃灣公園內繼續滋擾途人，期間一名伯伯不幸遭殃，片段中聽到該名伯伯說：<strong>「報警！你掟吖！我報警！」</strong>惟隨即再有一名騎着「子彈仔」的街童向他投擲物件。此外，影片中段更穿插了一張照片，顯示有人手上拿着俗稱「馬蹄鐵」的單車零件，未知是否與今次擲物襲擊事件有關。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h34m14s822.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026EDrn5ZUPVL1784692659.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h34m14s822.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h35m19s255.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20267QAQpNqMJX1784692657.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h35m19s255.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h34m09s931.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20268hCLWjA22v1784692658.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-10h34m09s931.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">影片曝光後隨即引發網絡熱議，大批網民紛紛指責該批「子彈仔」街童的行為極其離譜，並留言怒轟：「離晒大譜」、「整親人點算」、「暫時見到佢哋只恰老人家、欺善怕惡」。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">警方對此表示，於昨日（</span>20<span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">日）下午</span>6<span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">時</span>13<span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">分接獲報案，指一名</span>71<span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">歲的清潔男工在荃灣公園內，懷疑被</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">至</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">名青年投擲物件襲擊，同時亦有途人受到該批青年滋擾。警方已將案件暫列作「普通襲擊」，並交由荃灣警區軍裝巡邏小隊跟進，及後警方拘捕13歲男童涉襲擊罪。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T07:31:30.401913+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":452,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}